{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0168gYzBoSMUQTGuuB93gLid","type":"tool_result","content":"△ T05  index.html:308  div.layout > main.measure-prose > footer > p\n    正文每行约 41 个汉字（容器 576px ÷ 字号 14px），超过 40。基础档是估算，只报 warn；完整档实测超过 45 才报 error。\n    修法：见 skills/measure/references/typesetting.md#t05\n\n通过：1 个文件（含中文 1 个），0 个 error，1 个 warn。基础档不做完整层叠计算，结果是近似判断。","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7442fbda-a6ef-404f-a426-bf59ffe8f458","uuid":"0c029e46-3d27-4dc9-b441-39a867b73e61","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:37:33.665Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"△ T05  index.html:308  div.layout > main.measure-prose > footer > p\n    正文每行约 41 个汉字（容器 576px ÷ 字号 14px），超过 40。基础档是估算，只报 warn；完整档实测超过 45 才报 error。\n    修法：见 skills/measure/references/typesetting.md#t05\n\n通过：1 个文件（含中文 1 个），0 个 error，1 个 warn。基础档不做完整层叠计算，结果是近似判断。","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0168gYzBoSMUQTGuuB93gLid","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
